#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Boxes, news wires, and a cleaner Climate TRACE.

- The flat map zooms out further (to -2, MapLibre's limit).
- News wires: Subjects is now a drop-down row at the top of the filters, the
  same shape as Topic, Region and the rest; ticking happens in the list that
  drops down. Refresh sits inside the box, beside the search. Rolled up, the
  box sits at the top of the page; opened, it reaches down to the legend.
  The score filter's note is shorter.
- View and Basemap each roll up and down on their own caret.
- Climate TRACE at world view: small solid points with a dark rim, largest on
  top, and each subsector in its own muted colour, instead of translucent
  discs that merged into one wash.

Needs patch_list_0917.py and patch_world_terrain.py applied first.
Run from the repo root:  python3 patch_boxes_ct.py
"""
